formats/webgl
=============

A pure-JavaScript reader/builder for `.carbonwebgl` effect containers, and a
DXBC (Direct3D compiled shader bytecode) to GLSL ES 3.00 emitter for WebGL2.

The container is CarbonEngine's version-15 compiled-effect container, read and
written through the shared codec in `src/resource/format/carbonEffect`. That
codec ports CarbonEngine's `Tr2EffectRes.cpp` and the shader compiler's file
assembly, released by Fenris Creations (CCP Games) under the MIT License
(<https://github.com/carbonengine>); see `format-notices/hlsl`. The program
slots carry GLSL in place of DXBC, with an optional per-pass backend block.

The GLSL emitter is original CarbonEngineJS work. It reads DXBC only through
the sibling `formats/dxbc` reader, whose token format Microsoft publishes; see
`format-notices/dxbc`. Unity Technologies' HLSLcc (MIT) was used as a
behavioral reference while auditing the GLSL lowering rules; no HLSLcc source
is included in this repository.

Provenance
----------

The DXBC-to-GLSL emitter was first developed in this project's own prior-work
repository, `hlslreader`, and ported here. The earlier private `.cewg` chunk
container from that repository is retired; the Carbon container replaced it.

CarbonEngineJS-facing code is copyright cppctamber / CarbonEngineJS
contributors.

